# Cloudflare Pages headers — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Conservative security headers. No Content-Security-Policy on purpose:
# the site relies on inline scripts + third-party vendor JS (jQuery, Swiper, etc.),
# and a strict CSP would break them. Add HSTS at the Cloudflare zone level after
# confirming HTTPS works on softwarefirst.gr (don't hard-code it here).

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
